    "title": "⚾ Wildcats rally past Kingman/Norwich in 3A regional opener - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago KINGMAN, Kan. — No. 10 Haven used a pair of late scoring innings Wednesday to knock off No. 7 Kingman/Norwich 6-3 in a Class 3A baseball regional quarterfinal. The Wildcats improved to 14-11 and advanced to next Tuesday’s regional semifinal at No. 2 Burlington, which defeated No. 15 Fredonia 14-0. Kingman/Norwich ended its season 16-9. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
